.git
dist/
coverage.out
*.db
# docs/ is excluded, so every file docs/embed.go embeds needs an exception
# here or the image build fails with "no matching files found" while `make
# build` still passes — the local tree has the file, the build context does not.
docs/
!docs/embed.go
!docs/twillingate.md
!docs/deployment.md
!docs/reporting.md
!docs/plausible/plausible-shim.js
local/
# Built inside the image (web-build stage), never taken from the checkout.
web/node_modules
sdk/node_modules
internal/reporting/ui/*
!internal/reporting/ui/components.json
